       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. WEBECHO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-NAME PIC X(40).
       01 WS-OUT PIC X(80).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           EXEC CICS WEB READ FORMFIELD('name') VALUE(WS-NAME) END-EXEC.
           STRING '<p>' WS-NAME '</p>' DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OUT.
           EXEC CICS WEB SEND FROM(WS-OUT) END-EXEC.
           GOBACK.
